WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Thank you, everyone.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:11.000
My name is Teruyo Usa.

3
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:18.000
I run an Ainu restaurant called Harukor.

4
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:25.000
In addition, I also participate in a club called Yairenka.

5
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:31.000
The meaning of Yairenka is "happy" or "joy."

6
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:42.000
Anyway, we all in the club enjoy singing and dancing,

7
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:54.000
and we participate in activities to introduce
the fascinating Ainu culture to many people.

8
00:00:54.500 --> 00:01:08.000
I would like to keep the connection of history and culture
that has been built by our predecessors for the future.
